th older iphones as  well but with the latest ones you get  the extra features such as the visual  navigation  and i have to say these things really  help apple's ecosystem and make it much  harder to go  from an iphone and switch over to  something like a samsung even though i  would like to  previously you had imessage you had the  apple watch but  now with mac safe and air tags this  phone is just  incredible they're cheap they work well  i have a bunch of them i have them on  objects such as my boat  so that if somebody steals it i can  actually find it's just hidden there  i have them in my bags and the greatest  thing that happened lately was with the  beta  ios 15 it will actually give you  notifications  if you leave not only air tags so if you  leave your keys  or something else your bag somewhere but  also things like your ipad and other  apple  accessories and that just makes it so  nice to use an  iphone compared to something else and  now for the biggest  issue that is making me literally want  to leave this phone  and just downgrade to an iphone 12 that  is the display  and it's not really an issue with the  display itself the display is beautiful  hdr video looks amazing on it manual  brightness when you turn it all the way  up is  great this is apple's best display but  my issue  is with this largest display for example  this display gets really bright but if  you start  gaming on it after not that long it will  dim and if you're outside gaming or in a  bright room that can be an  issue and that is actually something  that doesn't happen with the iphone 12  mini and it's much less of an issue with  the iphone 12.  now i think that is probably because of  the display being much larger  extra pixels and that means extra heat  and it is really becoming an issue  especially in the last month  we're out here in summer now it's  getting hotter and i'm having so many  issues for example when i'm driving in  my truck  and it's a hotter day i have it set up  